# JXP test suite (linked framework)

When you change **linked jxp** (`../jxp` via `npm run link:jxp`) or JXP-related behavior in this API, run jxp tests before finishing:

```bash
cd ../jxp && npm run test
```

RevEngine's own tests do not cover jxp internals. Docs browser settings (`DOCS_ACCESS`, `DOCS_USER_EMAIL`) are implemented in jxp — see `../jxp/.cursor/rules/docs-auth.mdc` and `../jxp/test/docs_auth.test.js`.
